CORE
main.sh
--dynamic-resolutions all.json
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] .* is one of the candidates of shell-command-name:main.sh:10:1: greet, true: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
With a resolution, the command name is converted for its candidates only,
and is checked to be one of them.
